# Keyed-run template for Ethereum mainnet's fuel route: live-intent build/verify with --fuel-route, then
# `deploy-generation.ts deploy --fuel-route`. Each signing run chains `live-intent verify` ahead of it in one `bash -c`.
# `env-exec request --template packages/bridge-core/mainnet-l1.env.example -- …`
# PRIVATE_KEY must derive PLAN_PINNED_L1_SIGNERS.mainnet (the conductor and live-intent refuse any other signer).
# The owner creates Keyed-Runs/Unleashed-Mainnet by hand around that existing key; nothing generates one.
# ETH_RPC_URL broadcasts; the fork suite needs an archive endpoint.
PRIVATE_KEY=op://Keyed-Runs/Unleashed-Mainnet/PRIVATE_KEY
ETH_RPC_URL=op://Keyed-Runs/Unleashed-Mainnet/ETH_RPC_URL
# The owner's shared dRPC CLI key: the scripts compose the node URL from it and never print it.
DRPC_API_KEY=op://Keyed-Runs/dRPC-CLI/DRPC_API_KEY
